  "description": "This series contains 5 short stories:\n\n1. Sirius Lighthouse (시리우스 등대) [HL]  \n2. Aurora Valentine's Legacy (오로라 발렌타인의 유산) [No Coupling]  \n3. Farewell to the Black Sea (검은 바다의 작별) [GL]  \n4. The Bell Rings Twice (두 번 울리는 종소리) [HL]  \n5. The Red Snake Sleeping Tower (붉은 뱀이 잠드는 탑) [GL]\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n•Ridibooks: [1](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000203), [2](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000235), [3](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000233), [4](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000234), [5](https://ridibooks.com/books/1518000172)  \n•Naver Series: [1](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8144281), [2](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8454260), [3](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8453837), [4](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8454192), [5](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=6185562)\n\n**Illustration Collection Books:**  \nNOX, LUX  \n*Currently in Print only, not available in digital\n\n***Notes:**  \n•Some sites have Aurora Valentine's Legacy as HL but according to the author there's no coupling.  \n•All short stories have the same world building but with different characters and era's, the order is based on the author.  \n•Link to the author mini Twitter thread about the series info.*",
